  "status": "measured_pcm_with_estimated_phrase_timing",
  "captions": [
    {
      "segmentId": "S01",
      "startFrame": 132,
      "endFrame": 355,
      "text": "你此时此刻闪过的每\n一个念头，都伴随着"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S01",
      "startFrame": 355,
      "endFrame": 492,
      "text": "能量消耗，和热量释放。"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S02",
      "startFrame": 660,
      "endFrame": 962,
      "text": "1961年，兰道尔提出：\n在300K下，擦除一个"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S02",
      "startFrame": 962,
      "endFrame": 1198,
      "text": "未知比特，至少释放\n2.87仄焦耳热。"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S03",
      "startFrame": 1320,
      "endFrame": 1528,
      "text": "这不是芯片工艺缺陷；\n对不可逆擦除而言，"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S03",
      "startFrame": 1528,
      "endFrame": 1650,
      "text": "这是热力学的能耗下限。"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S04",
      "startFrame": 1860,
      "endFrame": 2072,
      "text": "进化约四十亿年，\n造就约二十瓦的人脑；"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S04",
      "startFrame": 2072,
      "endFrame": 2283,
      "text": "而硅基算力不断增长，\n也受不可逆擦除的"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S04",
      "startFrame": 2283,
      "endFrame": 2378,
      "text": "热力学下限约束。"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S05",
      "startFrame": 2700,
      "endFrame": 2971,
      "text": "即使每次不可逆擦除，\n都达到理论极限；"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S05",
      "startFrame": 2971,
      "endFrame": 3228,
      "text": "一万亿次，也只释放\n2.87纳焦耳。"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S05",
      "startFrame": 3228,
      "endFrame": 3454,
      "text": "危机来自，行星级\n运算的总热量。"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S06",
      "startFrame": 3660,
      "endFrame": 3946,
      "text": "根据斯特藩—玻尔兹曼定律，\n给定温度和发射率，"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S06",
      "startFrame": 3946,
      "endFrame": 4115,
      "text": "地球散热功率受\n表面积限制。"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S07",
      "startFrame": 4500,
      "endFrame": 4721,
      "text": "行星级算力的瓶颈，\n不只有供电，还有散热。"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S07",
      "startFrame": 4721,
      "endFrame": 4943,
      "text": "若不增加散热面积，\n巨量废热将威胁生物圈。"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S08",
      "startFrame": 5460,
      "endFrame": 5760,
      "text": "温暖的星球属于生命。\n超级智能或许会迁向更冷的深空；"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S08",
      "startFrame": 5760,
      "endFrame": 6000,
      "text": "但2.7开尔文是背景温度，\n不是运行温度。"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S09",
      "startFrame": 6360,
      "endFrame": 6475,
      "text": "一种未经证实的费米悖论假说"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S09",
      "startFrame": 6475,
      "endFrame": 6617,
      "text": "“这或许就是宇宙如此\n寂静的原因："
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S09",
      "startFrame": 6617,
      "endFrame": 6786,
      "text": "最高等的智慧，正躲在\n最寒冷的黑暗里静默"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S09",
      "startFrame": 6786,
      "endFrame": 6821,
      "text": "思考。”"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S10",
      "startFrame": 6960,
      "endFrame": 7015,
      "text": "下一次观测：主权心印。"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S10",
      "startFrame": 7015,
      "endFrame": 7090,
      "text": "[EP.06 当算法比你更懂你]"
    }
  ]
}
